  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1102.46 Project cost",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1102.46 “Project cost” means the applicant’s total direct and incidental costs of acquiring services, materials, and land, constructing infrastructure, and implementing the project for which assistance is sought.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Dw 1100) #13160, eff 1-20-21",
